From: Harry Weppner <harry@weppner.dev>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:51:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test--mrgingham-rotate-corners: find zsh on the PATH

It isn't always at /bin/zsh.
---
 test/test--mrgingham-rotate-corners | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/test/test--mrgingham-rotate-corners b/test/test--mrgingham-rotate-corners
index cbd931c..4d3833a 100755
--- a/test/test--mrgingham-rotate-corners
+++ b/test/test--mrgingham-rotate-corners
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-#!/bin/zsh
+#!/usr/bin/env zsh
 
 program=${0:h}/../mrgingham-rotate-corners
 datafile=${0:h}/data/data-for-rotate-corners.vnl
